# Added here: Humble Beginnings (399): taken in Stormwind on the way in, the compass at the
# Alexston Farmstead on the west loop, handed in on the Stormwind visit before the boat. Humans
# take Thor's flight to Stormwind on the first Sentinel Hill visit for Continue to Stormwind (6281),
# Dungar Longdrink (6261) and Return to Lewis (6285), and hand Elmore's Task (1097) to Grimand
# Elmore before the boat. Business in Auberdine (97894) is taken from Borgus Steelhand on that visit.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The road in: the Jansen Stead and Saldean's

step The Jansen Stead
  zone Westfall
  tip Follow the road from Elwynn into Westfall: the Furlbrows sit by their burned farm, the first one on the road. Pick up oats from any Sack of Oats you pass on the loop: the rest are gathered in the fields here on the way back.
  accept 109 npc 237 only Human -- Farmer Furlbrow; Humans took it from Deputy Rainer in Elwynn

step Westfall
  only Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne
  zone Westfall
  goto 59.9,19.4 "Westfall"

