  zone Westfall
  accept 36                                   -- Verna Furlbrow
  accept 184 optional                         -- Only if you looted a Westfall Deed in Elwynn: right-click it
  turnin 184 optional
  accept 151
  accept 64                                   -- Farmer Furlbrow

step Saldean's Farm
  tip South along the road, past the fork. Farmer Saldean stands outside, Salma in the house, Ozwin Ironsprocket in the barn to the west. Young Goretusks and Fleshrippers roam the fields around the farm: start on livers and the stew's meat on the way.
  turnin 36                                   -- Salma Saldean, inside
  accept 22
  accept 38
  accept 9                                    -- Farmer Saldean
  accept 92909                                -- Ozwin Ironsprocket

step Goretusk Snouts
  tip Young Goretusks root in the fields along the road south from Saldean's to Sentinel Hill: take their snouts on the way.
  collect 731 quest 38.3                      -- Goretusk Snout

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Sentinel Hill

step Sentinel Hill's tower and Thor
  only Human
  tip Gryan Stoutmantle and Captain Danuvin stand at the top of the stone tower, Quartermaster Lewis inside it, Thor the gryphon master on the south side of the hill. Thor gives you Lewis' note for Osric Strang with a free flight to Stormwind: take it now. Osric's shop, Limited Immunity, is in Old Town; Baros Alexston stands in Cathedral Square on the way back to Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master.
  turnin 109                                  -- Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 12
  accept 102                                  -- Captain Danuvin
  accept 6181                                 -- Quartermaster Lewis, inside
  getfp "Sentinel Hill"
  turnin 6181                                 -- Thor
  accept 6281                                 -- Thor: the free flight he offers goes to Stormwind
  fly "Stormwind"

