# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north loop
step Molsen Farm: kill these as you meet them
  zone Westfall
  tip Defias Trappers and Smugglers camp in the fields between Sentinel Hill and Molsen Farm.
  tip West of Saldean's. Harvest Watchers and Golems work the fields; they drop the isosprings, gyrostabilizers, Okra and sometimes a Precessive Autocognition Assembly. Foe Reaper 4000, a level 20 rare, walks here: leave it alone.
  tip Young Goretusks and Fleshrippers roam every leg of this loop: their livers and meat are for the pie and the stew.
  kill 95 quest 12
  kill 504 quest 12
  kill 114 quest 9                            -- Harvest Watchers
  collect 255007 quest 92909.1
  collect 255010 quest 92909.2
  collect 732 quest 38.4                      -- Okra
  collect 255155 optional                     -- Precessive Autocognition Assembly
  accept 92910 optional
  collect 254547 quest 92742.2 @46.1,38.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne -- Fill the vial at the farm's well
  collect 723 quest 22                        -- Goretusk Liver
  collect 729 quest 38.1                      -- Stringy Vulture Meat: Fleshrippers

step Furlbrow's Pumpkin Farm: kill these as you meet them
  zone Westfall
  tip Riverpaw Gnolls and Scouts (level 11-13) roam the hills south of the coast, from above Jangolode Mine east to the Jansen Stead. The gnolls further south and west are 13-19: stay in the north hills.
  tip Murloc Coastrunners and Raiders line the beach north of the mine. They flee at low health: pull one at a time.
  tip Careful: Gnolls that stand close together tend to join a fight as a group. Pulling one at a time is safer.
  tip Careful: Furlbrow's Wardrobe stands in the ruined house east of the mine, on the way to the Jansen Stead. Two Defias stand guard inside, one of them the level 15 named Benny Blaanco. They are linked, so attacking either one brings both.
  collect 725 quest 102 @44.7,14.6            -- Gnoll Paws
  collect 254548 quest 92744 only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne @43.5,9.2 map 1436 live -- Longshore Murloc Gills
  collect 730 quest 38.2 @43.5,9.2            -- Murloc Eye
  collect 841 quest 64                        -- Furlbrow's Wardrobe; inside
  collect 829 quest 153                       -- Red Leather Bandanas: every Defias drops them, from Jangolode Mine to the Jansen Stead

