# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The mines

step Jangolode Mine
  only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne
  tip Back north past Molsen Farm to the mine: Kobold Diggers work inside.
  kill 1236 quest 92745.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne -- Kobold Diggers

step The Gold Coast Quarry
  only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne
  tip South-west to the coast, west of Molsen Farm. Riverpaw Miners work the quarry.
  kill 1426 quest 92745.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne -- Riverpaw Miners

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West and south

step Moonbrook: kill these as you meet them
  zone Westfall
  tip Defias Pillagers and Looters hold the farms west of Sentinel Hill, between the coast road and Moonbrook. Alexston's Chest stands in the farmhouse at the Alexston Farmstead, among them: Baros' compass is inside.
  tip Careful: The Gold Coast Quarry cave holds many Defias packed together, so it is easy to pull several at once there.
  kill 589 quest 13
  kill 590 quest 13
  collect 2998 quest 399.1 @36.24,54.52       -- A Simple Compass, from Alexston's Chest

step Sentinel Hill
  turnin 13                                   -- Gryan Stoutmantle
