step Shaman training
  only Shaman
  zone Ironforge
  tip Head to Stormwind. It has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back for the boat.
  train class

